# Synology DS-212j disk hibernation (like DSM: Control Panel > Hardware & Power >
# HDD Hibernation). Minutes of inactivity before the internal disks spin down,
# 0 = never. Valid: 1..20, or a multiple of 30 up to 330 (hdparm -S limits).
# Applied when the disks appear (boot) and by: sudo udevadm trigger -c change -s block
SPINDOWN_MINUTES=10
